<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Opalescent Universe"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="乳白の宇宙"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="乳白的宇宙"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KAF"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="kaf"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="かふ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花譜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花谱"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Transcendent Love"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深愛"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深爱"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602601137"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3383669225"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0009OQdQ14A12F"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="667146774"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="0y17cFw04m6pivOhdmT6gi"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6764277986"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:27.500"><div begin="1.090" end="3:27.500"><p begin="1.090" end="7.730" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.090" end="2.200">今日</span><span begin="2.310" end="3.260">が</span><span begin="4.990" end="5.360">終</span><span begin="5.360" end="5.760">わ</span><span begin="5.760" end="6.000">り</span><span begin="6.160" end="6.700">な</span><span begin="6.790" end="6.940">の</span><span begin="7.040" end="7.730">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天是迎来了终结</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天是迎來了終結</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Is today the end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘이 끝나는 것인지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Est-ce la fin aujourd&apos;hui</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si hoy es el final</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist heute das Ende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se hoje é o fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сегодня это конец</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È la fine di oggi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou ga owari na no ka</span></p><p begin="9.560" end="13.590" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.560" end="10.300">始</span><span begin="10.390" end="10.770">ま</span><span begin="10.770" end="11.160">り</span><span begin="11.160" end="11.460">な</span><span begin="11.580" end="12.550">の</span><span begin="12.670" end="13.590">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是拉开了序幕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還是拉開了序幕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Or the beginning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시작되는 것인지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ou bien le commencement</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">O es el principio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oder der Anfang</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ou se é o começo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Или же начало</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">O è forse l&apos;inizio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hajimari na no ka</span></p><p begin="14.150" end="18.310" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.150" end="14.560">こ</span><span begin="14.560" end="14.940">れ</span><span begin="14.940" end="15.350">じゃ</span><span begin="15.350" end="15.640">わ</span><span begin="15.730" end="16.070">か</span><span begin="16.190" end="17.100">ら</span><span begin="17.340" end="18.020">な</span><span begin="18.020" end="18.310">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅凭这样无法知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">僅憑這樣無法知曉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I can&apos;t tell like this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이래서는 알 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme ça je n&apos;en sais rien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así no puedo saberlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So kann ich es nicht wissen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desse jeito não consigo saber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так и не пойму</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così non riesco a capirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ja wakaranai</span></p><p begin="19.520" end="26.130" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.520" end="20.460">咲</span><span begin="20.460" end="20.570">い</span><span begin="20.740" end="21.370">て</span><span begin="23.470" end="23.840">見</span><span begin="23.840" end="24.090">上</span><span begin="24.210" end="24.440">げ</span><span begin="24.440" end="24.680">る</span><span begin="24.680" end="25.470">頬</span><span begin="25.630" end="26.130">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在绽放着仰望的脸颊上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在綻放著仰望的臉頰上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">On the cheek looking up as it blooms</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">피어나 올려다보는 뺨에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sur mes joues qui s&apos;épanouissent en regardant vers le haut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En las mejillas que florecen y miran hacia arriba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf den blühenden aufschauenden Wangen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nas bochechas que desabrocham e olham para cima</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">На щеках что расцветают глядя вверх</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sulle guance arrossate che guardano in alto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Saite miageru hoho ni</span></p><p begin="28.080" end="31.720" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.080" end="28.720">温</span><span begin="28.860" end="29.230">も</span><span begin="29.230" end="29.590">り</span><span begin="29.590" end="29.800">を</span><span begin="29.800" end="29.920">受</span><span begin="30.030" end="30.930">け</span><span begin="31.200" end="31.720">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受着那份温暖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">感受著那份溫暖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Receiving warmth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">온기를 받으며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En recevant cette chaleur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Recibiendo calidez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Wärme empfangend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Recebendo o calor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ощутив тепло</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricevendo il tepore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nukumori o ukete</span></p><p begin="32.660" end="36.240" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.660" end="33.070">在</span><span begin="33.070" end="33.420">る</span><span begin="33.420" end="33.820">だ</span><span begin="33.820" end="34.210">け</span><span begin="34.210" end="34.400">の</span><span begin="34.400" end="34.510">こ</span><span begin="34.640" end="35.480">と</span><span begin="35.730" end="36.240">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅是存在于此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">僅僅是存在於此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just simply existing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 존재한다는 것만이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le simple fait d&apos;exister</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque el simple hecho de existir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil einfach nur zu existieren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O simples fato de existir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одно лишь то что я просто существую</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il solo fatto di esistere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aru dake no koto ga</span></p><p begin="36.880" end="42.670" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.880" end="37.280">究</span><span begin="37.280" end="37.580">極</span><span begin="37.690" end="37.890">と</span><span begin="37.890" end="38.250">思</span><span begin="38.250" end="38.370">え</span><span begin="38.470" end="38.750">て</span><span begin="38.750" end="38.900">し</span><span begin="38.900" end="39.410">ま</span><span begin="39.410" end="39.590">う</span><span begin="39.590" end="39.970">か</span><span begin="39.970" end="42.670">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让人觉得这已是究极的圆满</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就讓人覺得這已是究極的圓滿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I end up thinking it is the ultimate thing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">궁극의 의미라 생각되어 버리니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Me semble être l&apos;ultime accomplissement</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Termina pareciéndome lo supremo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mir als das Ultimative erscheint</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Acaba parecendo ser o ápice para mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кажется мне абсолютным пределом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi sembra la cosa più assoluta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyuukyoku to omoete shimau kara</span></p><p begin="48.470" end="52.480" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.470" end="49.230">安</span><span begin="49.230" end="49.600">ら</span><span begin="49.600" end="50.000">ぎ</span><span begin="50.000" end="50.270">の</span><span begin="50.360" end="50.640">最</span><span begin="50.790" end="51.800">中</span><span begin="51.930" end="52.480">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在宁静的极境之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在寧靜的極境之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In the midst of tranquility</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">평온함의 한가운데서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au beau milieu de la quiétude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En medio de la tranquilidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Inmitten der tiefsten Geborgenheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No meio da tranquilidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В самом сердце покоя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nel mezzo della tranquillità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yasuragi no sanaka de</span></p><p begin="53.060" end="56.970" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.060" end="53.340">生</span><span begin="53.430" end="53.830">け</span><span begin="53.830" end="54.200">る</span><span begin="54.200" end="54.610">愛</span><span begin="54.610" end="55.170">の</span><span begin="55.170" end="55.390">手</span><span begin="55.390" end="56.540">触</span><span begin="56.540" end="56.970">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鲜活爱意的触感</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">鮮活愛意的觸感</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The touch of living love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">살아 숨 쉬는 사랑의 감촉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le toucher d&apos;un amour vivant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El tacto del amor viviente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Berührung lebendiger Liebe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O toque do amor vivo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прикосновение живой любви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il tocco dell&apos;amore vivo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikeru ai no tezawari</span></p><p begin="57.260" end="1:03.210" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.260" end="57.700">そう</span><span begin="57.700" end="58.340">か</span><span begin="58.430" end="58.680">こ</span><span begin="58.680" end="58.850">れ</span><span begin="58.850" end="59.480">が</span><span begin="59.610" end="1:00.200">私</span><span begin="1:00.300" end="1:00.600">の</span><span begin="1:01.120" end="1:01.400">完</span><span begin="1:01.500" end="1:01.930">成</span><span begin="1:01.930" end="1:02.340">だ</span><span begin="1:02.340" end="1:02.570">っ</span><span begin="1:02.570" end="1:03.210">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样啊 这就是我所追寻的完整</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這樣啊 這就是我所追尋的完整</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I see this was my completion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그렇구나, 이것이 나의 완성이었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois c&apos;était donc ça ma complétude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya veo así que esta era mi perfección</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah das war also meine Vollendung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Entendo então esta era a minha completude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот как значит это и было моим завершением</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah capisco era questa la mia completezza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Souka kore ga watashi no kansei datta</span></p><p begin="1:03.830" end="1:11.100" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.830" end="1:04.380">人</span><span begin="1:04.940" end="1:05.530">生</span><span begin="1:06.130" end="1:06.440">を</span><span begin="1:06.840" end="1:08.450">遡</span><span begin="1:08.450" end="1:08.850">る</span><span begin="1:08.850" end="1:09.110">み</span><span begin="1:09.210" end="1:10.020">た</span><span begin="1:10.020" end="1:10.290">い</span><span begin="1:10.410" end="1:11.100">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如溯流回溯人生一般</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">宛如溯流回溯人生一般</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">As if tracing back through life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">인생을 거슬러 올라가듯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme si je remontais le cours de ma vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si retrocediera en la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als würde ich das Leben zurückverfolgen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se voltasse no tempo da vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно возвращаясь вспять по реке жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come per risalire la corrente della vita</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jinsei o sakanoboru mitai ni</span></p><p begin="1:11.510" end="1:15.430" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.510" end="1:11.860">乳</span><span begin="1:11.860" end="1:12.250">白</span><span begin="1:12.250" end="1:12.520">の</span><span begin="1:12.620" end="1:13.040">線</span><span begin="1:13.040" end="1:13.630">を</span><span begin="1:13.630" end="1:14.410">辿</span><span begin="1:14.410" end="1:14.600">っ</span><span begin="1:14.600" end="1:14.990">た</span><span begin="1:14.990" end="1:15.430">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是循着那乳白的丝线</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若是循著那乳白的絲線</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I follow the opalescent line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">유백색의 선을 따라가 보니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En suivant cette ligne d&apos;un blanc laiteux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si sigo la línea de un blanco lechoso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich der milchweißen Linie folge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ao traçar a linha branco-leitosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если пойти по молочно-белой линии</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Seguendo la linea color bianco latte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nyuuhaku no sen o tadottara</span></p><p begin="1:15.730" end="1:20.650" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.730" end="1:16.060">そう</span><span begin="1:16.160" end="1:16.800">か</span><span begin="1:16.900" end="1:17.150">こ</span><span begin="1:17.150" end="1:17.320">れ</span><span begin="1:17.320" end="1:17.990">が</span><span begin="1:18.090" end="1:18.680">私</span><span begin="1:18.780" end="1:19.090">の</span><span begin="1:19.570" end="1:19.780">欲</span><span begin="1:19.780" end="1:19.970">し</span><span begin="1:19.970" end="1:20.160">か</span><span begin="1:20.160" end="1:20.360">っ</span><span begin="1:20.360" end="1:20.650">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样啊 这才是我一直渴望的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這樣啊 這才是我一直渴望的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I see this was what I wanted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그렇구나, 이것이 내가 원했던</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois c&apos;était donc ça que je désirais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya veo esto era lo que yo quería</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah das war es also was ich wollte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Entendo então era isso que eu queria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот как значит это то чего я желала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah capisco era questo ciò che volevo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Souka kore ga watashi no hoshikatta</span></p><p begin="1:21.090" end="1:24.600" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.090" end="1:21.800">小</span><span begin="1:21.890" end="1:22.160">規</span><span begin="1:22.280" end="1:22.540">模</span><span begin="1:22.680" end="1:22.900">な</span><span begin="1:22.900" end="1:22.940">宇</span><span begin="1:23.050" end="1:23.420">宙</span><span begin="1:23.420" end="1:23.530">を</span><span begin="1:23.670" end="1:24.030">統</span><span begin="1:24.030" end="1:24.270">べ</span><span begin="1:24.270" end="1:24.600">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">统御这小小宇宙的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">統御這小小宇宙的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Governing a small-scale universe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소규모의 우주를 아우르는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Régnant sur un univers à petite échelle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Gobernando un universo a pequeña escala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das unschuldige Strahlen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Governando um universo em pequena escala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Правящее этой маленькой вселенной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che governa un piccolo universo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shoukibo na uchuu o suberu</span></p><p begin="1:25.020" end="1:29.760" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.020" end="1:25.280">無</span><span begin="1:25.380" end="1:25.630">垢</span><span begin="1:25.630" end="1:25.910">の</span><span begin="1:26.280" end="1:27.560">輝</span><span begin="1:27.700" end="1:29.760">き</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无暇的光辉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無瑕的光輝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Innocent radiance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무구한 빛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un éclat d&apos;une pureté immaculée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un resplandor inmaculado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ein kleines Universum beherrscht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O brilho da inocência</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Невинное сияние</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uno splendore innocente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Muku no kagayaki</span></p><p begin="1:47.280" end="1:53.710" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.280" end="1:48.450">ドー</span><span begin="1:48.450" end="1:48.830">ル</span><span begin="1:51.090" end="1:51.320">知</span><span begin="1:51.320" end="1:51.510">っ</span><span begin="1:51.510" end="1:51.920">て</span><span begin="1:51.920" end="1:52.120">い</span><span begin="1:52.290" end="1:52.690">た</span><span begin="1:52.880" end="1:53.020">の</span><span begin="1:53.150" end="1:53.550">か</span><span begin="1:53.550" end="1:53.680">い</span><span begin="1:53.680" end="1:53.710">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">玩偶啊 你是早就知晓的吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">玩偶啊 你是早就知曉的嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Doll did you know?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">인형아, 너는 알고 있었니?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Poupée le savais-tu ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Muñeca tú lo sabías?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Puppe hast du es gewusst?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Boneca você sabia?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кукла знала ли ты об этом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Bambola tu lo sapevi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dooru shitte ita no kai?</span></p><p begin="1:55.740" end="1:59.760" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.740" end="1:56.770">宝</span><span begin="1:56.920" end="1:57.290">の</span><span begin="1:57.290" end="1:57.670">在</span><span begin="1:57.760" end="1:58.680">処</span><span begin="1:58.840" end="1:59.760">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在宝藏的所在之处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在寶藏的所在之處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">At the whereabouts of the treasure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">보물이 있는 곳에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Là où se trouve le trésor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En el escondite del tesoro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Am Fundort des Schatzes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No esconderijo do tesouro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Там где спрятано сокровище</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nel luogo in cui si trova il tesoro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Takara no arika de</span></p><p begin="2:00.340" end="2:04.360" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.340" end="2:01.060">共</span><span begin="2:01.150" end="2:01.400">に</span><span begin="2:01.530" end="2:01.870">寝</span><span begin="2:01.870" end="2:02.150">そ</span><span begin="2:02.290" end="2:03.120">べ</span><span begin="2:03.120" end="2:03.420">っ</span><span begin="2:03.420" end="2:04.360">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你一同并肩躺下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與你一同並肩躺下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lying down together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">함께 엎드려 누워서는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Allongées ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Acostadas juntas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gemeinsam liegend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deitando-nos juntas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы лежали вместе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sdraiandoci insieme</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tomo ni nesobette</span></p><p begin="2:05.510" end="2:12.270" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.510" end="2:06.590">育</span><span begin="2:06.590" end="2:06.910">っ</span><span begin="2:06.910" end="2:07.620">て</span><span begin="2:09.600" end="2:10.360">年</span><span begin="2:10.360" end="2:10.580">行</span><span begin="2:10.770" end="2:11.200">く</span><span begin="2:11.400" end="2:11.620">ほ</span><span begin="2:11.820" end="2:12.270">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随着不断成长岁月流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">隨著不斷成長歲月流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The more I grow and age</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자라나 나이를 먹어갈수록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Plus je grandis et prends de l&apos;âge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuanto más crezco y envejezco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Je mehr man wächst und älter wird</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quanto mais cresço e envelheço</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чем больше расту и взрослею</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Più si cresce e passano gli anni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sodatte toshi yuku hodo</span></p><p begin="2:14.230" end="2:18.390" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.230" end="2:14.860">脆</span><span begin="2:14.980" end="2:15.280">く</span><span begin="2:15.380" end="2:15.770">な</span><span begin="2:15.770" end="2:16.040">る</span><span begin="2:16.200" end="2:17.110">の</span><span begin="2:17.300" end="2:18.390">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反而变得愈发脆弱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">反而變得愈發脆弱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The more fragile I become</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여려지는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Plus je deviens fragile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Más frágil me vuelvo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Desto zerbrechlicher wird man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mais frágil eu fico</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тем более хрупкой становлюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Più si diventa fragili</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Moroku naru no sa</span></p><p begin="2:18.820" end="2:23.590" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.820" end="2:19.100">向</span><span begin="2:19.190" end="2:19.590">け</span><span begin="2:19.590" end="2:19.990">ら</span><span begin="2:19.990" end="2:20.290">れ</span><span begin="2:20.390" end="2:20.670">た</span><span begin="2:20.780" end="2:21.790">愛</span><span begin="2:21.930" end="2:22.880">情</span><span begin="2:23.110" end="2:23.590">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面对那倾注而来的爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">面對那傾注而來的愛意</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To the affection directed at me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 향해 쏟아지는 애정에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Face à cette affection qui m&apos;est adressée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por el afecto dirigido hacia mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gegenüber der entgegengebrachten Liebe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ao afeto direcionado a mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">К обращенной на меня любви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dall&apos;affetto che mi viene rivolto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mukerareta aijou ni</span></p><p begin="2:24.220" end="2:32.900" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.220" end="2:24.620">撫</span><span begin="2:24.620" end="2:24.990">で</span><span begin="2:24.990" end="2:25.390">る</span><span begin="2:25.390" end="2:26.090">よ</span><span begin="2:26.090" end="2:26.190">う</span><span begin="2:26.190" end="2:26.380">に</span><span begin="2:26.380" end="2:27.260">柔</span><span begin="2:27.260" end="2:27.540">い</span><span begin="2:27.540" end="2:28.310">二</span><span begin="2:28.310" end="2:28.490">つ</span><span begin="2:28.490" end="2:28.840">の</span><span begin="2:28.840" end="2:29.450">声</span><span begin="2:29.450" end="2:29.730">音</span><span begin="2:29.730" end="2:30.090">に</span><span begin="2:30.090" end="2:30.510">揺</span><span begin="2:30.830" end="2:31.280">ら</span><span begin="2:31.280" end="2:31.810">れ</span><span begin="2:31.980" end="2:32.360">て</span><span begin="2:32.360" end="2:32.900">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那宛如轻抚般柔和的两道声音中摇曳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在那宛如輕撫般柔和的兩道聲音中搖曳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Swayed by two soft voices like a caress</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어루만지듯 부드러운 두 목소리에 흔들리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis bercée par deux voix douces comme une caresse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me dejo mecer por dos voces tan suaves como una caricia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gewiegt von zwei sanften Stimmen die mich wie eine Liebkosung streicheln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sendo embalada por duas vozes macias como um carinho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Укачиваемая двумя голосами нежными словно поглаживание</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vengo cullata da due voci morbide come una carezza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Naderu you ni yawai futatsu no kowane ni yurareteru</span></p><p begin="2:33.790" end="2:43.910" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.790" end="2:34.010">一</span><span begin="2:34.140" end="2:34.580">生</span><span begin="2:34.580" end="2:34.950">を</span><span begin="2:34.950" end="2:35.270">か</span><span begin="2:35.360" end="2:35.650">け</span><span begin="2:35.750" end="2:36.100">て</span><span begin="2:36.100" end="2:36.520">さ</span><span begin="2:36.520" end="2:36.660">え</span><span begin="2:36.750" end="2:36.920">見</span><span begin="2:36.920" end="2:37.110">当</span><span begin="2:37.270" end="2:37.660">た</span><span begin="2:37.660" end="2:37.900">ら</span><span begin="2:38.060" end="2:38.370">な</span><span begin="2:38.370" end="2:38.490">い</span><span begin="2:38.780" end="2:39.560">類</span><span begin="2:39.560" end="2:39.650">の</span><span begin="2:39.770" end="2:40.170">経</span><span begin="2:40.310" end="2:40.630">験</span><span begin="2:40.900" end="2:41.200">だ</span><span begin="2:41.200" end="2:41.490">っ</span><span begin="2:41.490" end="2:43.910">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那是穷尽一生也难以寻觅的体验</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那是窮盡一生也難以尋覓的體驗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It was the kind of experience you couldn&apos;t find even if you spent a lifetime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">일생을 바친다 해도 찾아볼 수 없는 부류의 경험이었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;était le genre d&apos;expérience introuvable même en y consacrant toute une vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Fue el tipo de experiencia que no encontraría ni dedicando toda mi vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es war eine Art von Erfahrung die man selbst in einem ganzen Leben nicht findet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi o tipo de experiência que não se encontra nem dedicando a vida inteira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это был опыт который не найти даже за целую жизнь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È stata un&apos;esperienza tale che non si troverebbe nemmeno in una vita intera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Isshou o kakete sae miataranai tagui no keiken datta</span></p><p begin="2:46.140" end="2:50.260" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.140" end="2:46.900">長</span><span begin="2:46.900" end="2:47.320">い</span><span begin="2:47.320" end="2:48.100">夢</span><span begin="2:48.100" end="2:48.380">の</span><span begin="2:48.520" end="2:49.630">中</span><span begin="2:49.630" end="2:50.260">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这漫长的梦境之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在這漫長的夢境之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Inside a long dream</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기나긴 꿈속에서 맞이한</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans un long rêve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dentro de un largo sueño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einem langen Traum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dentro de um longo sonho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В долгом сне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un lungo sogno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nagai yume no naka de</span></p><p begin="2:50.570" end="2:54.680" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.570" end="2:50.760">二</span><span begin="2:50.760" end="2:51.040">度</span><span begin="2:51.140" end="2:51.530">目</span><span begin="2:51.530" end="2:51.750">の</span><span begin="2:51.920" end="2:52.290">モ</span><span begin="2:52.290" end="2:52.890">ラ</span><span begin="2:52.890" end="2:53.140">ト</span><span begin="2:53.140" end="2:53.870">リ</span><span begin="2:53.870" end="2:54.140">ア</span><span begin="2:54.260" end="2:54.680">ム</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迎来第二次的休憩期</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">迎來第二次的休憩期</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A second moratorium</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두 번째 유예의 시간</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon deuxième moratoire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una segunda moratoria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das zweite Moratorium</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A segunda moratória</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мой второй мораторий</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una seconda moratoria</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nidome no moratoriamu</span></p><p begin="2:54.990" end="3:00.930" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.990" end="2:55.290">どう</span><span begin="2:55.400" end="2:56.050">か</span><span begin="2:56.160" end="2:56.400">こ</span><span begin="2:56.400" end="2:56.580">れ</span><span begin="2:56.580" end="2:57.180">が</span><span begin="2:57.280" end="2:57.550">覚</span><span begin="2:57.550" end="2:57.630">め</span><span begin="2:57.730" end="2:57.910">て</span><span begin="2:58.050" end="2:58.330">も</span><span begin="2:58.790" end="2:59.050">消</span><span begin="2:59.200" end="2:59.480">さ</span><span begin="2:59.610" end="2:59.960">な</span><span begin="2:59.960" end="3:00.270">い</span><span begin="3:00.270" end="3:00.930">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈求你哪怕大梦初醒 也不要将其抹除</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">祈求你哪怕大夢初醒 也不要將其抹除</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please don&apos;t erase this even when I wake up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부디 꿈에서 깨더라도 이것을 지우지 말아 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t&apos;en prie ne l&apos;efface pas même si je m&apos;éveille</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por favor no borres esto aunque despierte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bitte lösche dies nicht aus selbst wenn ich erwache</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por favor mesmo que eu acorde não apague isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу не стирай это даже когда я проснусь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti prego non cancellarlo anche quando mi sveglierò</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Douka kore ga samete mo kesanaide</span></p><p begin="3:01.480" end="3:08.730" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.480" end="3:02.040">人</span><span begin="3:02.620" end="3:03.340">生</span><span begin="3:03.790" end="3:04.100">を</span><span begin="3:04.410" end="3:04.890">歩</span><span begin="3:04.990" end="3:05.280">き</span><span begin="3:05.380" end="3:06.190">疲</span><span begin="3:06.190" end="3:06.540">れ</span><span begin="3:06.540" end="3:06.810">た</span><span begin="3:06.930" end="3:07.940">頃</span><span begin="3:08.100" end="3:08.730">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当在这段人生旅途中走得疲惫不堪时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當在這段人生旅途中走得疲憊不堪時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When I get tired of walking through life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">인생을 걸어가다 지칠 즈음에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand je serai fatiguée de marcher à travers la vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando esté cansada de caminar por la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich müde bin vom Gehen durchs Leben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando eu estiver cansada de caminhar pela vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда я устану идти по жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando sarò stanca di camminare nella vita</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jinsei o arukitsukareta koro ni</span></p><p begin="3:09.030" end="3:13.180" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.030" end="3:09.990">再</span><span begin="3:09.990" end="3:10.360">び</span><span begin="3:10.360" end="3:10.590">こ</span><span begin="3:10.590" end="3:10.800">こ</span><span begin="3:10.800" end="3:11.350">で</span><span begin="3:11.350" end="3:11.620">出</span><span begin="3:11.620" end="3:12.320">逢</span><span begin="3:12.320" end="3:12.570">い</span><span begin="3:12.700" end="3:13.090">た</span><span begin="3:13.090" end="3:13.180">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要再次在这里与你相逢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想要再次在這裡與你相逢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to meet here again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 한번 이곳에서 만나고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je voudrais te rencontrer ici à nouveau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero que nos volvamos a encontrar aquí de nuevo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Möchte ich dem hier wieder begegnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero me encontrar aqui novamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хочу встретиться здесь снова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio poterti incontrare di nuovo qui</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Futatabi koko de deaitai</span></p><p begin="3:13.450" end="3:18.330" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.450" end="3:13.870">遠</span><span begin="3:13.870" end="3:14.480">く</span><span begin="3:14.600" end="3:14.900">遠</span><span begin="3:15.000" end="3:15.720">く</span><span begin="3:15.720" end="3:16.150">忘</span><span begin="3:16.150" end="3:16.270">れ</span><span begin="3:16.410" end="3:16.740">て</span><span begin="3:17.070" end="3:17.170">し</span><span begin="3:17.290" end="3:17.470">ま</span><span begin="3:17.470" end="3:17.640">い</span><span begin="3:17.640" end="3:17.890">そ</span><span begin="3:17.890" end="3:18.080">う</span><span begin="3:18.080" end="3:18.330">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那几乎要被远远遗忘的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那幾乎要被遠遠遺忘的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Seemingly forgetting it far far away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아득히 머나먼 곳에 잊어버릴 것만 같은</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si lointain si lointain que je pourrais presque l&apos;oublier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A lo lejos muy a lo lejos como si fuera a olvidarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Welches ich weit weit weg fast zu vergessen scheine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O qual parece que vou esquecer num lugar muito muito distante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Такое далёкое далёкое что кажется вот-вот забудется</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lontano lontano come se stessi per dimenticarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tooku tooku wasurete shimaisou na</span></p><p begin="3:18.790" end="3:22.300" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.790" end="3:19.510">小</span><span begin="3:19.600" end="3:19.870">規</span><span begin="3:19.990" end="3:20.280">模</span><span begin="3:20.370" end="3:20.600">な</span><span begin="3:20.600" end="3:20.660">宇</span><span begin="3:20.760" end="3:21.070">宙</span><span begin="3:21.070" end="3:21.230">を</span><span begin="3:21.350" end="3:21.640">占</span><span begin="3:21.730" end="3:21.970">め</span><span begin="3:21.970" end="3:22.300">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">占据这小小宇宙的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">佔據這小小宇宙的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Occupying a small-scale universe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소규모의 우주를 채우는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Occupant un univers à petite échelle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ocupando un universo a pequeña escala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein kleines Universum erfüllend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ocupando um universo em pequena escala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Заполняющее эту маленькую вселенную</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che occupa un piccolo universo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shoukibo na uchuu o shimeru</span></p><p begin="3:22.700" end="3:27.500" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.700" end="3:23.070">無</span><span begin="3:23.070" end="3:23.350">垢</span><span begin="3:23.350" end="3:23.620">の</span><span begin="3:24.010" end="3:25.370">輝</span><span begin="3:25.570" end="3:27.500">き</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无暇的光辉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無瑕的光輝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Innocent radiance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무구한 빛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un éclat d&apos;une pureté immaculée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un resplandor inmaculado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das unschuldige Strahlen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O brilho da inocência</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Невинное сияние</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uno splendore innocente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Muku no kagayaki</span></p></div></body></tt>